      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Self-contained controlled-vocabulary constraints for mobilityDCAT-AP 3.0.0 (spec section 10.2). Restates the EU authority-table and mobility CV bindings rather than importing DCAT-AP's CV shapes, since that import is not 1:1. 10.2.1 MUST uses sh:node at Violation; 10.2.2/10.2.3 use the exact at-least-one-with-extras-tolerated form at Warning."
      }
