        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Values classify the theme of a mobility dataset using the Mobility Theme controlled vocabulary (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-theme), which is organised in two hierarchy levels: data content category and data content sub-category. At least one value must come from this vocabulary; if no applicable concept exists, use the 'other' value (https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-theme/other). Values outside the vocabulary are tolerated."
      }
